<title>INDIA: Indian July fertiliser output rises.</title>
<headline>Indian July fertiliser output rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's fertiliser production rose in July compared with the same month last year, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    PRODUCTION     Jul 96  Jul 95	   Apr-July</p>
<p>						   1996/97  1995/96</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous     722	668	  2,411     2,726</p>
<p>    Phosphatic	192	217	    692	 810</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes.</p>
</text>
